Syntax grammars (bat, via two-face) — compiled into the full build
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:    https://github.com/CosmicHorrorDev/two-face, https://github.com/sharkdp/bat
License:   the grammars' own (MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD and others), each listed in
           two-face's acknowledgements

The TUI highlights code (crates/krowk-tui/src/syntax.rs) with Sublime Text
grammars as bat collects them, which two-face ships as a syntect dump. The dump
is embedded in the `harness` build, so the grammars' authors are credited
here; two-face's acknowledgements carry each grammar's license text.

