--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:    https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0039/english.txt
           (sha256 2f5eed53a4727b4bf8880d8f3f199efc90e58503646d9ff8eff3a2ed3b24dbda)
License:   MIT (BIP-0039: "This BIP falls under the MIT License.")
Copyright: Marek Palatinus, Pavol Rusnak, Aaron Voisine, Sean Bowe

crates/krowk-client/src/english.txt is BIP-0039's English list of 2048 words,
unchanged. krowk's recovery phrase writes the account key as 24 of these words
with BIP-0039's checksum; the encoding in crates/krowk-client/src/phrase.rs is
krowk's own.
